    {
      "id": "a7c8f9d6-e728-4177-a73e-950462f99d22",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Pokud ale definujeme parametr typu \u0060ref int\u0060 a argument metody p\u0159ed\u00E1me jako \u0060ref x\u0060, tak p\u0159ed\u00E1v\u00E1me referenci na argument a zm\u011Bna prom\u011Bnn\u00E9 na hodnotu \u00600\u0060 zm\u011Bn\u00ED i p\u0159edan\u00FD argument."
    },
    {
      "id": "906080c5-8188-4c40-a5f6-37551750c6a7",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Trida\n{\n    public void Zmen(ref int x)\n    {\n        x = 0;\n    }\n}\n\nTrida trida = new Trida();\n\nint x = 3;\n\ntrida.Zmen(ref x);\n\nx",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E0\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 25
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a6768fb-61fd-4a71-b764-b898b2e632b3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "S pomoc\u00ED kl\u00ED\u010Dov\u00E9ho slova \u0060ref\u0060 bychom si mohli napsat metodu, kter\u00E1 by prohodila hodnoty dvou prom\u011Bnn\u00FDch. Jde jen o uk\u00E1zkov\u00FD k\u00F3d, pro prohozen\u00ED m\u016F\u017Eeme pou\u017E\u00EDt z\u00E1pis \u0060(a, b) = (b, a)\u0060."
    },
    {
      "id": "b652dd02-ff55-4ba1-96b0-f4446f74ba9e",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "void Prohod(ref int a, ref int b)\n{\n    int temp = a;\n    a = b;\n    b = temp;\n}\n\nint a = 2;\nint b = 3;\n\nProhod(ref a, ref b); // (a, b) = (b, a);\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\u0022a: {a} b: {b}\u0022);",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "a: 3 b: 2\r\n",
          "channel": "stdout"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9538a21b-16fc-448f-baa0-2632b9934a78",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Kl\u00ED\u010Dov\u00E9 slovo \u0060out\u0060 je stejn\u00E9 jako \u0060ref\u0060, jen se vy\u017Eaduje aby m\u011Bl parametr v metod\u011B p\u0159i\u0159azenou hodnotu."
    },
    {
      "id": "c4c2d2e2-c3ab-4011-b8a2-998538dddf32",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Trida\n{\n    public void Zmen(out int x)\n    {\n        x = 0; // zkuste si zakomentovat tento radek a vyzkousejte kod s out int a ref int\n        \u002B\u002Bx; // samotny radek bez predchoziho prirazeni nepujde prelozit\n    }\n}\n\nTrida trida = new Trida();\n\n//int x = 3;\n\ntrida.Zmen(out int x);\n\nx",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E1\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "execution_count": 31
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "72129990-0041-4c6c-8935-e551e0eefa76",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Referen\u010Dn\u00ED typ jako parametr metody\n\nPokud je parametrem referen\u010Dn\u00ED typ, na\u0159\u00EDklad t\u0159\u00EDda, tak se kop\u00EDruje reference, a ob\u011B reference, tedy parametr i argument odkazuj\u00ED na stejn\u00FD objekt v pam\u011Bti."
    },
    {
      "id": "9f68e355-c2e3-490c-804d-69a704fea023",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Cislo\n{\n    public int x;\n}\n\nclass Trida\n{\n    public void Zmen(Cislo cislo)\n    {\n        cislo.x = 0;\n    }\n}\n\nCislo cislo = new Cislo();\ncislo.x = 3;\n\nTrida trida = new Trida();\n\ntrida.Zmen(cislo);\n\ncislo.x\n",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
          "content": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022dni-plaintext\u0022\u003E\u003Cpre\u003E0\u003C/pre\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cstyle\u003E\r\n.dni-code-hint {\r\n    font-style: italic;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview {\r\n    white-space: nowrap;\r\n}\r\n.dni-treeview td {\r\n    vertical-align: top;\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ndetails.dni-treeview {\r\n    padding-left: 1em;\r\n}\r\ntable td {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\ntable tr { \r\n    vertical-align: top; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px;\r\n}\r\ntable tr td pre \r\n{ \r\n    vertical-align: top !important; \r\n    margin: 0em 0px !important;\r\n} \r\ntable th {\r\n    text-align: start;\r\n}\r\n\u003C/style\u003E"
        }
