    {
      "id": "811f26b1-685c-4136-b5f8-860949db1f55",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "D\u00E1vejte pozor, kdybych v metod\u011B m\u011Bnili parametr (kopii referenci), tak tato zm\u011Bna nem\u00E1 vliv na p\u016Fvodn\u00ED objekt."
    },
    {
      "id": "43a49705-b22d-433f-876a-a7b6318176b0",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "class Cislo\n{\n    public int x;\n}\n\nclass Trida\n{\n    public void Zmen(Cislo cislo)\n    {\n        cislo = new Cislo() { x = 0 };\n    }\n}\n\nCislo cislo = new Cislo();\ncislo.x = 3;\n\nTrida trida = new Trida();\n\ntrida.Zmen(cislo);\n\ncislo.x\n",
      "outputs": [
