      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "Stejn\u00FD p\u0159\u00EDpad je i n\u00E1sleduj\u00EDc\u00ED p\u0159\u00EDklad s polem, kde m\u011Bn\u00EDm pouze parametr (kopii reference)."
